# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated code — NOT committed (decision recorded in substage 3.3.4)
#
# Two reasons:
#   1. Generated files in a diff obscure the real change. Every commit in this
#      project is meant to be reviewable.
#   2. Regenerating in CI verifies that generation still WORKS on every push,
#      which is strictly stronger than trusting a committed artefact that might
#      no longer match its source.
#
# The cost: `flutter pub run build_runner build` must run before analyze or test
# on a fresh clone. The CI pipeline (substage 3.5) does exactly that, and
# docs/DEVELOPMENT.md documents it for local use.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.g.dart
*.freezed.dart
*.mocks.dart

